{% extends "_base.j2" %}
{% block body %}
Draft an outline for an academic paper.

Topic: {{ topic }}
Target venue: {{ format_spec.venue_label }} ({{ format_spec.display_name }})
Target language: {{ format_spec.language }}
Target length: {{ length_pages }} pages, {{ format_spec.columns }}-column.
Required sections (in order): {{ format_spec.section_order | join(", ") }}

Return strict JSON of shape:
{
  "title": "<paper title>",
  "abstract_brief": "<one-sentence pitch>",
  "keywords": ["kw1", "kw2", ...],
  "sections": [
     { "name": "<must match a required section>", "bullets": ["sub-claim 1", "sub-claim 2", ...] },
     ...
  ]
}
Output ONLY the JSON.
{% endblock %}
